This licence covers the code in this repository only.

Data retains the licence of its source. In particular:

  * Boundary geometry in site/tiles/ and the identifiers derived from it come
    from geoBoundaries (https://www.geoboundaries.org/) and are CC BY 4.0,
    except where an individual country's boundary inherits ODbL or CC-BY-SA
    from OpenStreetMap. Per-file licences are recorded in
    data/raw/boundaries/manifest.json. Redistribution must keep the
    geoBoundaries attribution.
  * CIA World Factbook content is in the public domain.
  * Natural Earth content is public domain (CC0).
  * Wikidata content is CC0.
  * National statistical office data keeps each agency's own terms; see
    docs/SOURCES.md.
